--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: SubtitlesTable_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 77ce4b83a5fc04946a85908cd3884a7a, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 9327254630400
    m_Localized: Hello, student! I am Mark 2000, the artificial intelligence of the
      programming stations of the universe.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9327263019008
    m_Localized: "This is the first station on Earth and my robotic body still doesn\u2019t
      know how to move here."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9327271407616
    m_Localized: I need your help to calibrate it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9327271407617
    m_Localized: To move around the station, click the green arrows. You will be
      transported to them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9327271407618
    m_Localized: In this station, you will always move using the green arrows. They
      show where you can go.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9327275601920
    m_Localized: Keep moving like this to help me learn how humans explore space.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9327275601921
    m_Localized: The green arrows show where you can go. Aim at them and click to
      continue.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9327275601922
    m_Localized: This is Mark, my robotic avatar in this station. He is fully functional,
      but still don't know how to use it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9327283990528
    m_Localized: So that I can operate this body, I need you to show me how it should
      move.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9327283990529
    m_Localized: Aim and click on the green arrow to continue.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9327283990530
    m_Localized: "For me to operate Mark\u2019s body, I need you to transform your
      ideas into instructions, or rather, into algorithms, or programs!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9327283990531
    m_Localized: "This is the station\u2019s computer. This is where programs are
      created."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9327283990532
    m_Localized: Do you know these symbols written on the cubes? You call them arrows,
      right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9327288184832
    m_Localized: Each board of the computer is a space where you can place a cube.
      Your program must always start with the Start cube and end with the End cube.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9327288184833
    m_Localized: The arrow cubes are the filling!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9327288184834
    m_Localized: Go on and experiment! Take the cubes, place them on the boards,
      and rearrange them however you like.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9327288184835
    m_Localized: Notice that the computer has a limited number of boards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9327292379136
    m_Localized: This defines the size of the program you can create.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9327296573440
    m_Localized: "Now you know how to build an algorithm. Let\u2019s use it to move
      Mark."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9327296573441
    m_Localized: "It\u2019s time to truly calibrate Mark. Let\u2019s create a program
      with Start, three movements, and End."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9327296573442
    m_Localized: To move him away from the doorway, turn left and move forward twice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9327296573443
    m_Localized: When you are ready, press the blue Play button to execute.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9327300767744
    m_Localized: If you want to start again, press the orange Reset button
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9327300767745
    m_Localized: Excellent! I can interpret your commands and operate my new body.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9327300767746
    m_Localized: The initial calibration is complete. Thank you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9327300767747
    m_Localized: "Before we begin the station\u2019s official challenges, you can
      adjust the station\u2019s settings as you prefer."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9415288877056
    m_Localized: My body froze again! I can't even walk!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9415288877057
    m_Localized: We're going to have to reset it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9415288877058
    m_Localized: Go to the platform on your right to help me regain control!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9415288877059
    m_Localized: To move my body again, you're going to program it with an algorithm!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9415293071360
    m_Localized: 'The reset code is: forward, forward, left, forward, and right.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9415293071361
    m_Localized: Grab the Cubes and place them on the Computer! Then just hit Play!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9415293071362
    m_Localized: "Don\u2019t forget the Start and End of the algorithm"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9426244399104
    m_Localized: "I'm regaining control, but I\u2019ll still need help programming
      my body."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9426244399105
    m_Localized: "We\u2019ll need to take a few laps around here."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9426244399106
    m_Localized: Can you help me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9426244399107
    m_Localized: "Let\u2019s practice a few turns, to see if my sensors are still
      working."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9426248593408
    m_Localized: "I\u2019ve got a new formula to help you!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9426248593409
    m_Localized: Repeat left 4 times and then go forward.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9426248593410
    m_Localized: Then repeat right 5 times and go forward.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9426252787712
    m_Localized: "Don\u2019t forget to mark the beginning and end of the code"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9436986011648
    m_Localized: "Good news: Mark\u2019s motors are working again! Let\u2019s see
      if he can take a little trip around the room."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9436990205952
    m_Localized: Can you help guide Mark?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9436990205953
    m_Localized: Program Mark to go around an obstacle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9436990205954
    m_Localized: He needs to go around this pillar and return to where he started.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9436994400256
    m_Localized: To make the first turn, Mark needs to move forward twice and then
      once to the left.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9436994400257
    m_Localized: Use a Loop block and set the block sequence that you want to repeat
      together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9436994400258
    m_Localized: "Don\u2019t forget to add a block to start and another to end the
      code!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
